<title>PORTUGAL: Bank of Portugal injects 6.0 bln esc, 6.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Bank of Portugal injects 6.0 bln esc, 6.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal said it injected six billion escudos of 10-day funds into the money market at an unchanged weighted average rate of 6.7 percent in a variable rate repurchase tender.</p>
<p>It offered 50 billion escudos in today's repo.</p>
<p>-- LISBON BUREAU 3511-3538254</p>
</text>
